## OneCaller (first-party) + geo

- CallScreening + Contacts Directory are first-party clean-room.
- Full prefix index: `assets/caller/geo.dat` — binary compatible with the
  common phone.dat layout, dataset from [sndnvaps/Phonedata](https://github.com/sndnvaps/Phonedata)
  (**MIT**), version marker `2302` (~4.1MB, public-collected prefixes per upstream).
- Small override/sample: `assets/caller/geo_v1.json` (`onetools.geo.v1`).
- **Do not** bundle GPL-licensed phone datasets (e.g. xluohome/phonedata LICENSE GPL-3).

